#. type: \b; header
#: ../E/cbot.txt:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Programming - the CBOT language"
msgstr "Programación - el lenguaje CBOT"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/cbot.txt:2
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The CBOT language is very close in structure and syntax to C++ and Java. It has been adapted for the specific purposes of COLOBOT, and for an efficient pedagogical approach.\n"
"This language is made up of instructions (see below), <a cbot|bloc>blocks</a>, <a cbot|function>functions</a>, <a cbot|class>classes</a>, <a cbot|var>variables</a>, <a cbot|array>arrays</a>, <a cbot|expr>expressions</a> and <a cbot|cond>conditions</a>."
msgstr ""
"El lenguaje CBOT es muy similar en estructura y sintaxis a C++ y Java. Ha sido adaptado para los propósitos específicos de COLOBOT y para un enfoque pedagógico eficiente.\n"
"Este lenguaje se compone de instrucciones (ver más abajo), <a cbot|bloc>bloques</a>, <a cbot|function>funciones</a>, <a cbot|class>clases</a>, <a cbot|var>variables</a>, <a cbot|array>arrays</a>, <a cbot|expr>expresiones</a> y <a cbot|cond>condiciones</a>."

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../E/cbot.txt:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code><format type>Type</format></code>"
msgstr "<code><format type>Tipo</format></code>"

#. type: Bullet: 'o'
#: ../E/cbot.txt:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "<code><format const>Constants</format></code>"
msgstr "<code><format const>Constantes</format></code>"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/cbot.txt:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instructions in the CBOT language:"
msgstr "Instrucciones en el lenguaje CBOT:"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/cbot.txt:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specific instructions for bots:"
msgstr "Instrucciones específicas para bots:"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/cbot.txt:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instructions about topology:"
msgstr "Instrucciones sobre topología:"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/cbot.txt:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instructions specific to some bots:"
msgstr "Instrucciones específicas para algunos bots:"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/cbot.txt:80
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specific instructions for exchange posts:"
msgstr "Instrucciones específicas para centros de intercambio:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/cbot.txt:81
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|receive>receive</a>    </code>Receives an information\n"
"<code><a cbot|send>send</a>       </code>Sends a new information\n"
"<code><a cbot|testinfo>testinfo</a>   </code>Tests if an information exists\n"
"<code><a cbot|delinfo>deleteinfo</a> </code>Deletes an existing information"
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|receive>receive</a>    </code>Recibe información\n"
"<code><a cbot|send>send</a>       </code>Envía nueva información\n"
"<code><a cbot|testinfo>testinfo</a>   </code>Comprueba si existe información\n"
"<code><a cbot|delinfo>deleteinfo</a> </code>Borra información existente"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/cbot.txt:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specific instructions for classes:"
msgstr "Instrucciones específicas para clases:"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/cbot.txt:98
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specific instructions for strings:"
msgstr "Instrucciones específicas para cadenas:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/cbot.txt:99
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|strlen>strlen</a>     </code>Gets string length\n"
"<code><a cbot|strleft>strleft</a>    </code>Extracts left part\n"
"<code><a cbot|strright>strright</a>   </code>Extracts right part\n"
"<code><a cbot|strmid>strmid</a>     </code>Extracts center part\n"
"<code><a cbot|strfind>strfind</a>    </code>Finds a substring.\n"
"<code><a cbot|strval>strval</a>     </code>Converts string to number\n"
"<code><a cbot|strupper>strupper</a>   </code>Converts to upper case\n"
"<code><a cbot|strlower>strlower</a>   </code>Converts to lower case"
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|strlen>strlen</a>     </code>Obtiene longitud de cadena\n"
"<code><a cbot|strleft>strleft</a>    </code>Extrae parte izquierda\n"
"<code><a cbot|strright>strright</a>   </code>Extrae parte derecha\n"
"<code><a cbot|strmid>strmid</a>     </code>Extrae parte central\n"
"<code><a cbot|strfind>strfind</a>    </code>Busca subcadena\n"
"<code><a cbot|strval>strval</a>     </code>Convierte cadena a número\n"
"<code><a cbot|strupper>strupper</a>   </code>Convierte a mayúsculas\n"
"<code><a cbot|strlower>strlower</a>   </code>Convierte a minúsculas"

#. type: \t; header
#: ../E/cbot.txt:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specific instructions for files:"
msgstr "Instrucciones específicas para archivos:"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../E/cbot.txt:109
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<code><a cbot|open>open</a>       </code>Opens a file\n"
"<code><a cbot|close>close</a>      </code>Closes a file\n"
"<code><a cbot|writeln>writeln</a>    </code>Writes line to a file\n"
"<code><a cbot|readln>readln</a>     </code>Reads line from a file\n"
"<code><a cbot|eof>eof</a>        </code>Tests if end of file\n"
"<code><a cbot|deletef>deletefile</a> </code>Deletes a file"
msgstr ""
"<code><a cbot|open>open</a>       </code>Abre un archivo\n"
"<code><a cbot|close>close</a>      </code>Cierra un archivo\n"
"<code><a cbot|writeln>writeln</a>    </code>Escribe línea en archivo\n"
"<code><a cbot|readln>readln</a>     </code>Lee línea de archivo\n"
"<code><a cbot|eof>eof</a>        </code>Comprueba fin de archivo\n"
"<code><a cbot|deletef>deletefile</a> </code>Borra un archivo"

